      "scope": "native process cleanup acceptance",
      "status": "static_addressed_runtime_pending",
      "source": "remaining-native-webview.py:151-169",
      "problem": "session_close_error can be recorded while overall state remains passed; process-group termination is not separately verified.",
      "requested": "Keep cleanup as an explicit acceptance result and fail/open on unresolved cleanup failure.",
