      "scope": "native local control-channel isolation",
      "status": "static_addressed_runtime_pending",
      "source": "remaining-native-webview.py:64-69",
      "problem": "The driver child has an environment allowlist, but urllib uses the Python parent default proxy configuration.",
      "requested": "Use an explicit ProxyHandler({}) for localhost WebDriver requests.",
      "impact": "The allowlist alone does not prove local requests bypass inherited proxies.",
      "reviewed_revision_sha256": "edecb2b804f8d933053bbb174b293872aa99b07c8edce25ea57a772d957ba755",
      "resolution": "Lines 59 and 69 use ProxyHandler({}) through a dedicated opener."
